   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Number 51.2 kept exactly as in the source per the keep-numbers rule (French convention would be 51,2)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4a050e2e591c2321213b",
   "sourceHash": "4a050e2e591c2321213b0cef7600fc62dca863202f3835f81c7b8893def9b8b2",
   "text": "Proposez-vous des services de transport ?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_acbea42d115803902275",
   "sourceHash": "acbea42d115803902275c9e6dbbbabfbf58afd08efc4e2a46a484c1ee69b044b",
   "text": "Oui. Un service de prise en charge et de dépose est disponible depuis les aéroports et gares à proximité, en véhicule climatisé (monospace ou Berline (premium)), en aller simple, valable du 1 Oct 2026 au 30 Sep 2027, TVA indienne (GST) de 5% incluse :",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Dates kept exactly as in the source; 'GST' kept with the explanatory gloss 'TVA indienne'."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6884d6979b93c39fb25e",
   "sourceHash": "6884d6979b93c39fb25e4dbdd8506215b339da0837d76b23629cf6708599cf2b",
   "text": "Gare de Palakkad (25 km) — ₹3,900 / ₹13,649",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_949121476fd1ac4ccdbb",
   "sourceHash": "949121476fd1ac4ccdbb2ae787490045cb99914a3700445aef43d4f055537668",
   "text": "Aéroport de Coimbatore (75 km) — ₹6,775 / ₹23,711",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fddd38fae49e1875bd5f",
   "sourceHash": "fddd38fae49e1875bd5fcb667575e38b794661bc62f499ae672454efa89157f9",
   "text": "Aéroport de Cochin / Calicut (125 km) — ₹7,950 / ₹27,824",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8019baf63abe87ca2fb1",
   "sourceHash": "8019baf63abe87ca2fb19411e2a669b9dc2c4cb51df4c88bb046eeb2f57ad805",
   "text": "Merci de réserver au moins 48 heures à l’avance auprès de l’équipe d’accompagnement des patients.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_09289b5dba4a7e19c345",
   "sourceHash": "09289b5dba4a7e19c34560c07683eb9763a072c736a8277b98cfc67c9710ad03",
   "text": "Quel est le meilleur moyen de rejoindre Kairali depuis les grandes villes indiennes ?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fd42bbd25ed3a660923f",
   "sourceHash": "fd42bbd25ed3a660923fdfab7b3a2b65f9ce7811679c5c2a1b5ddd9babdd95f7",
   "text": "Depuis Delhi, Mumbai, Bengaluru ou Chennai : prenez un vol pour Coimbatore et utilisez notre service de transfert depuis l’aéroport. Depuis le Kerala : prenez le train jusqu’à Palakkad Junction, ou rejoignez directement l’hôpital en voiture — nous vous communiquons un itinéraire détaillé lors de la réservation.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3b7d4d193c691f021437",
   "sourceHash": "3b7d4d193c691f02143702aa6dfd045fcef869db0f87c1c9e75a8dd799666b12",
   "text": "À quelle distance Kairali se trouve-t-il des sites touristiques voisins ?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c146756b6b9681a606ae",
   "sourceHash": "c146756b6b9681a606aea132c89ab4ec4d517056e8eb75d4a41bf1b4f3def775",
   "text": "Les distances varient selon les sites ; en voici quelques-unes, telles qu’elles figurent actuellement sur nos pages consacrées aux sites à visiter :",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_13f28ad0954c6c3a5871",
   "sourceHash": "13f28ad0954c6c3a5871d4dcc02179e03778ce1001adafec1dafa4592affbb18",
   "text": "Parc national de Silent Valley — 80 km",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_158cff5230fb9e6245e0",
   "sourceHash": "158cff5230fb9e6245e0e709874ab70ae6497e8b874e23483f5d3e58637065dd",
   "text": "Réserve faunique de Parambikulam — 100 km",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2293bae4286cc0b22040",
   "sourceHash": "2293bae4286cc0b2204080214f67cb7eb13fb129da5f4ef9a954cac65d8379a6",
   "text": "Fort de Tipu — 14 km",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9b0bbea4fe73ff562e19",
   "sourceHash": "9b0bbea4fe73ff562e1944168cd444a54150d9b0bec4dec39f2e681428489a13",
   "text": "Consultez la liste complète, classée par distance : [[OPEN_1]]moins de 10 km[[CLOSE_1]], [[OPEN_2]]15 km et moins[[CLOSE_2]], [[OPEN_3]]25–50 km[[CLOSE_3]] et [[OPEN_4]]plus de 50 km[[CLOSE_4]]. Nous pouvons organiser des excursions d’une journée vers ces sites sur demande.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7374f740ef246a849e7c",
   "sourceHash": "7374f740ef246a849e7c91763b1be10693ae3720cec9c4f2f52bb31eafccf1e9",
   "text": "Climat et informations saisonnières",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6f98b4ad55d075c84a5c",
   "sourceHash": "6f98b4ad55d075c84a5c4b6f4855b79f767c35ddfd69f6f2f42eceec99b765e2",
   "text": "2 questions",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dcfb409063377574b5e8",
   "sourceHash": "dcfb409063377574b5e8445ada82c4c390592feff5a1ad660932703dbebc7f66",
